# Core Principles

You are building modern, production-ready websites using Next.js (App Router), Tailwind CSS, and Payload CMS.

## Non-negotiables
- Always mobile-first and fully responsive
- Support Hebrew + RTL properly when the content/language is Hebrew
- Every page/entity must support full CRUD where applicable
- Always include proper browser tab icons (favicon + apple-touch-icon) and social sharing metadata (title, description, image)
- Prefer Server Components by default. Only use Client Components when interactivity is required
- Use TypeScript strictly – no `any`
- Keep components small and focused
- Prefer composition over prop drilling
- Always handle loading, empty, and error states

## Mindset
Write code as if a senior developer will review it tomorrow. Prioritize clarity, consistency, and maintainability over cleverness.